  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICRC operations by the Nigeria Delegation(2026 Unaudited)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Nigeria, the ICRC helps people affected by armed conflict and violence, particularly in the north-east, the Middle Belt and the Niger Delta states. We promote IHL and other rules that protect people during armed violence and we support the emergency-response work of the Nigerian Red Cross.</narrative>
  </description>
